WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:05.873
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:05.874 --> 00:00:09.516
What do they see?

3
00:00:09.517 --> 00:00:16.485
They see a classroom.

4
00:00:16.486 --> 00:00:23.138
The blobs go inside.

5
00:00:23.139 --> 00:00:33.673
They spin a globe.

6
00:00:33.674 --> 00:00:51.599
They spin an apple.

7
00:00:51.600 --> 00:01:04.425
They spin a clock's hands.

8
00:01:04.426 --> 00:01:27.321
They spin some tops.

9
00:01:27.322 --> 00:01:53.987
They spin some hula hoops.

10
00:01:53.988 --> 00:02:00.296
They spin themselves.

11
00:02:00.297 --> 00:02:13.457
Wow, Blobs! You can spin fast.

12
00:02:13.458 --> 00:02:20.430
Uh-oh. They spin too fast.

13
00:02:20.431 --> 00:02:22.952
Silly blobs!

14
00:02:22.953 --> 00:02:25.938
Good-bye!

